    "sentence_translations": [
      "Where is the seat for my ticket?",
      "",
      "Little Wang took the train for a business trip.",
      "After boarding the train, he noticed someone was sitting in his seat.",
      "He walked over, deliberately held out the ticket to the person sitting in the seat, and said:",
      "“Hello. I can’t read. Could you help me look where the seat for my ticket is?”",
      "The person took a look at Little Wang’s ticket and said: “It’s a standing ticket. You can stand wherever you want.”"
